  "title": "Republic of the Congo: TotalEnergies Makes a Hydrocarbon Discovery on the Moho License",
  "summary": "Paris, April 13, 2026 – TotalEnergies EP Congo (63.5%, operator) announces a hydrocarbon discovery on the Moho license, offshore the Republic of Congo, following the drilling of the MHNM-6 NFW exploration well targeting the Moho G structure. The well encountered a hydrocarbon column of approximately 160 meters in good-quality Albian reservoirs, and an extensive data […]",
